(Transformer architectures have redefined statistical language modeling by replacing recurrence with) Tj
T* (multi-head self-attention mechanisms. By enabling global context interaction across token positions,) Tj
T* (attention layers capture long-range semantic dependencies that recurrent networks historically degraded.) Tj
